# pipa-ui currently reads no environment variables at all: it's a Leptos CSR app that
# compiles to wasm32-unknown-unknown and runs entirely in the browser, so it has no
# process environment to read from at runtime.
#
# The pipa-rest API base URL it talks to (src/api.rs::API_BASE) is a compile-time
# constant hardcoded to http://localhost:8080, matching `just rest`'s default. This file
# is kept for consistency with the other crates and as a placeholder for when that
# becomes build-time configurable (e.g. via Trunk's own .env support).
